00:31:48,555 --> 00:31:57,555
OUR SPARKLE Ookami Mio 1st Live.
[OUR SPARKLE - Ookami Mio 1st Live.]

100
00:32:06,255 --> 00:32:10,255
しじまに響くような My Heart
My heart resonating through the silence...

101
00:32:10,855 --> 00:32:14,555
大神ミオ ソロライブ 始まるよー！
Ookami Mio's Solo Live begins now!

102
00:32:21,555 --> 00:32:26,055
とうとうと流れてく風景
The scenery flows steadily past,

103
00:32:26,055 --> 00:32:31,055
刹那的な日々の中で
Amidst these transient days.

104
00:32:31,555 --> 00:32:36,055
差し伸べられた手は優しく
The hand reached out to me was gentle,

105
00:32:36,055 --> 00:32:42,555
鼓動に滴る ルビー熱の予感
A ruby dripping into my pulse, a foreboding of heat.

106
00:32:42,855 --> 00:32:45,855
風に吹かれる
Blown by the wind,

107
00:32:45,855 --> 00:32:49,055
そう生きてきたから
That is how I have lived.

108
00:32:49,055 --> 00:32:52,055
君に会って気づく
Meeting you made me realize...

109
00:32:52,055 --> 00:32:55,055
もう一人じゃない
I am not alone anymore!

110
00:32:55,055 --> 00:32:59,055
射光 瞬きは声
Flashing light, blinking like voices,

111
00:32:59,055 --> 00:33:02,555
描き続け響く
Resonating as we keep drawing forward.

112
00:33:02,555 --> 00:33:06,055
爪弾く道 漆黒の胸
Plucking the path in this pitch-black heart,

113
00:33:06,055 --> 00:33:11,555
ともに駆けてく夜
A night we dash through together.

114
00:33:11,555 --> 00:33:15,555
遠く電波する思いは
Feelings transmitted from afar,

115
00:33:15,555 --> 00:33:19,555
心燃やす情熱
A passion burning in my heart.

116
00:33:19,555 --> 00:33:22,055
世界はいいんだよ
The world is fine as it is,

117
00:33:22,055 --> 00:33:25,555
後ろに君がいるから
Because you are behind me.

118
00:33:25,555 --> 00:33:28,055
私は迷わない
I will not hesitate,

119
00:33:28,055 --> 00:33:31,555
光差す道へ
Towards the light-filled path!

120
00:33:32,055 --> 00:33:35,255
無力だから 仲間を求め
Being powerless, I sought companions;

121
00:33:35,255 --> 00:33:38,555
凍えるから 火を灯して
Freezing, I lit a fire.

122
00:33:38,555 --> 00:33:44,055
変化とともに 進化していく
Evolving along with the changes,

123
00:33:44,055 --> 00:33:49,555
この顛末は 誰も知らない
No one knows how this story ends.

124
00:33:50,055 --> 00:33:53,255
君を信じる
I believe in you;

125
00:33:53,255 --> 00:33:56,555
そう決めているから
That's what I've decided,

126
00:33:56,555 --> 00:33:59,555
どんな非情も
So no matter how cruel it gets,

127
00:33:59,555 --> 00:34:02,055
乗り越えられるよ
I can overcome it!

128
00:34:02,055 --> 00:34:05,555
月光 この闇に唯一
Moonlight, the sole flower

129
00:34:05,555 --> 00:34:08,055
凛と咲く花
Blooming bravely in this darkness.

130
00:34:08,055 --> 00:34:11,055
恐れなのか 憧れなのか
Is it fear or longing?

131
00:34:11,055 --> 00:34:14,055
向かい合う夜空
Facing the night sky,

132
00:34:14,055 --> 00:34:17,555
未知を駆け抜ける私と
Running through the unknown, you and I

133
00:34:17,555 --> 00:34:20,055
君が作り出す
Create together

134
00:34:20,055 --> 00:34:22,555
この物語
This story.

135
00:34:22,555 --> 00:34:25,055
単純な未来じゃない
It's no simple future;

136
00:34:25,055 --> 00:34:27,555
湧き立つ情熱
Let's carry this surging passion

137
00:34:27,555 --> 00:34:30,055
この声に乗せよう
Upon this voice!

138
00:34:30,055 --> 00:34:33,255
空飛ぶ羽はなくても
Even without wings to fly,

139
00:34:33,255 --> 00:34:36,555
手は繋げられたから
Because we were able to hold hands,

140
00:34:36,555 --> 00:34:39,555
この運命を選んだ
I chose this destiny.

141
00:34:39,555 --> 00:34:43,055
連鎖する遠吠えは
Chaining howls

142
00:34:43,055 --> 00:34:46,255
しじまに響いて
Echo through the silence,

143
00:34:46,255 --> 00:34:49,055
何度も何度も
Time and time again,

144
00:34:49,055 --> 00:34:52,555
その絆を確かめ合った
Reaffirming that bond between us.

145
00:35:04,963 --> 00:35:07,763
夜の静寂は 越え行く気配
The signs of passing through the night's silence,

146
00:35:07,763 --> 00:35:10,863
月へ響く 爪弾く路
Resonating to the moon along this plucked path.

147
00:35:10,863 --> 00:35:14,263
金狼の群れ 共になげく夜
A night where the pack of golden wolves laments together.

148
00:35:14,363 --> 00:35:19,363
慟哭 伝播する思いは 心強くする
Wailing, these spreading feelings make my heart stronger.

149
00:35:19,363 --> 00:35:23,763
共に行こうよ 隣に君がいるから
Let's go together, because you are by my side.

150
00:35:23,763 --> 00:35:28,063
私は迷わない 光射す道へ
I will not hesitate on the path toward the light.

151
00:35:34,063 --> 00:35:37,863
Listen to my howling...

152
00:35:40,163 --> 00:35:43,363
狼が止まることはない
The wolf will never stop.

153
00:36:02,463 --> 00:36:04,363
まだまだ走るよ！
We're still gonna keep running!

154
00:36:04,463 --> 00:36:06,363
みんな ついてきて！
Everyone, follow me!

155
00:36:12,963 --> 00:36:16,563
どこまで行こうか ネイビーの夜空に
How far shall we go into the navy night sky,

156
00:36:16,563 --> 00:36:19,463
映る昨日の自分
Reflecting who I was yesterday?

157
00:36:19,463 --> 00:36:23,563
夢見がちだった ベビーフェイスにさようなら
Goodbye to the dream-prone baby face.

158
00:36:24,363 --> 00:36:29,363
見たくないもの照らす ハイビームに走る衝動
Impulses rushing under high beams that illuminate things I don't want to see.

159
00:36:30,163 --> 00:36:34,563
跳ね除けて前へ行けば 信号は皆 色を失くし消えた
Pushing past them to move forward, the traffic lights all lost their color and vanished.

160
00:36:36,863 --> 00:36:43,363
確かめたい 未知が続く慰めを
I want to feel the comfort of an unknown path stretching ahead.

161
00:36:44,563 --> 00:36:48,763
深く深く濃くなる 夜を揺らす
Shaking the night that grows deeper, darker, and thicker,

162
00:36:48,763 --> 00:36:54,963
微かな速度の光さえ 越えて行けるほどに
Enough to surpass even the faint speed of light.

163
00:36:57,163 --> 00:37:00,363
強く強く踏み込んで
Stepping down hard, with all my strength,

164
00:37:00,363 --> 00:37:04,263
僕は駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
I dash straight ahead,

165
00:37:04,363 --> 00:37:08,863
譲れない思いを抱いて
Holding onto feelings I cannot yield.

166
00:37:22,363 --> 00:37:27,463
標識だらけの街を抜け出して 明日を探してた
Escaping the signpost-riddled town, I searched for tomorrow,

167
00:37:27,463 --> 00:37:32,763
常識の波に全部雑多と溶かしてた
Melting everything cluttering into the waves of common sense.

168
00:37:34,363 --> 00:37:38,563
どこまで行けるのなんて 聞き合ったセリフ
"How far can we go?"—the line we kept asking each other,

169
00:37:39,363 --> 00:37:44,963
吐いて 曇った窓ガラスに描いた本音
Breathing onto the fogged window pane and writing our true feelings,

170
00:37:44,963 --> 00:37:47,763
すぐに指で消した
Only to erase them quickly with a finger.

171
00:37:48,163 --> 00:37:51,563
臆病でも
Even if I'm faint-hearted...

172
00:37:51,563 --> 00:37:57,363
揺るぎない軌跡 確かめた願いを胸に 遥か遠く
With an unshakeable locus and confirmed wishes in my heart, far into the distance,

173
00:37:57,563 --> 00:38:02,863
軋むように軋んでも この灯火を灯し続け
Even if it creaks and groans, I'll keep lighting this flame,

174
00:38:03,363 --> 00:38:08,363
ただ一つ答えを追いかけて
Chasing after a single answer.

175
00:38:09,963 --> 00:38:14,963
脆くてもいい この腕で掴むために
It's fine to be fragile, as long as I can grasp it with these arms,

176
00:38:14,963 --> 00:38:20,863
手を伸ばすよ 内鳴らす鼓動の限り
I reach out my hand for as long as my heartbeat thumps inside.

177
00:38:46,163 --> 00:38:52,563
この道で迷って 見失って どこへ行くの
Getting lost on this path, losing my way, where am I heading?

178
00:38:56,163 --> 00:39:03,563
目指す場所 その意味も ひとつしかないのに
Even though there's only one destination and one meaning to it all.

179
00:39:03,763 --> 00:39:12,363
曇った視界は 夜に溶けても もう一度開けて行く
Even if my clouded vision dissolves into the night, it will clear up once again.

180
00:39:12,863 --> 00:39:17,163
視線の先 僕を連れて行くよ きっと
Where my gaze leads, it will surely take me there.

181
00:39:20,363 --> 00:39:22,363
みんな！行くよー！
Everyone! Here we go!

182
00:39:22,863 --> 00:39:27,863
深く深く濃くなる 息を吸って 今加速を
Taking a deep, deep breath, accelerating right now,

183
00:39:27,863 --> 00:39:33,763
傷つくほどに強く成ろう
Let's grow strong enough to endure the pain.

184
00:39:35,163 --> 00:39:40,763
確かめたい色 動き出す 纏っている その体で
With that body clad in colors I want to confirm, starting to move,

185
00:39:40,763 --> 00:39:45,963
鮮やかな夜空の果てへ
Heading toward the edges of the vivid night sky,

186
00:39:45,963 --> 00:39:48,163
忘れないように
So I never forget.

187
00:39:48,363 --> 00:39:53,363
深く深く濃くなれ 今を生きる この加速の
Growing deeper, deeper, and darker, living in the present of this acceleration,

188
00:39:53,363 --> 00:39:58,563
光だって超えて行ける場所へ
To a place that can surpass even the light itself.

189
00:39:59,363 --> 00:40:02,363
強く強く踏み込んで
Stepping down hard, with all my strength,

190
00:40:02,363 --> 00:40:04,963
僕を駆ける ただ真っ直ぐに
Running straight ahead through my own path,

191
00:40:04,963 --> 00:40:08,363
譲れない思いを抱いて
Holding onto feelings I cannot yield.

192
00:40:07,451 --> 00:40:10,851
想いを抱いて 止まらないで
Holding onto my feelings, don't stop,

193
00:40:11,151 --> 00:40:16,351
走り続ける意味を知るから
because I know the meaning of continuing to run.

194
00:40:31,251 --> 00:40:34,451
きっと未来は色に溢れ
Surely the future will overflow with color,

195
00:40:34,451 --> 00:40:37,851
まだ見ぬ世界をカラフルに染める
painting the unseen world in vivid hues.

196
00:40:37,851 --> 00:40:41,351
もっと自由になりたいから
Because I want to be even more free,

197
00:40:41,351 --> 00:40:45,851
ずっと ずっと ずっと 夢見てるの
I've been dreaming forever, forever, forever.

198
00:40:58,851 --> 00:41:04,851
空に光る星のように 輝きたいと願う夜
On nights when I wish to shine like a star glowing in the sky,

199
00:41:05,051 --> 00:41:11,051
広い世界に存在を証明したくて
wanting to prove my existence to this vast world...

200
00:41:11,351 --> 00:41:17,651
出来ないことばかり数えても 胸が苦しくなるだけでしょ
Even if I only count what I can't do, it'll only make my heart ache.

201
00:41:17,851 --> 00:41:24,351
私だって絶対 あの日の夢の続きになれるはず
Even I can surely become the continuation of that day's dream.

202
00:41:25,651 --> 00:41:30,351
響く音色の中ほら 未知なる景色
Look, amidst the echoing melody lies an unknown landscape.

203
00:41:30,651 --> 00:41:36,651
どこか感じてたのに 近づいた気がしたんだ
Though I felt it somewhere, I felt like I've gotten closer.

204
00:41:37,051 --> 00:41:43,351
そっと伸ばしたこの手の先 描いた理想が想像を超える
Beyond this hand gently reached out, the ideal I drew exceeds imagination.

205
00:41:43,551 --> 00:41:52,851
やっと見つける私の色 ずっと ずっと ずっと 追いかけるの
Finally finding my color, I'll chase after it forever, forever, forever.

206
00:41:59,351 --> 00:42:05,651
限りないことを思い描いた 瞳に映るすべて
Everything reflected in my eyes, envisioning endless possibilities,

207
00:42:05,851 --> 00:42:11,851
変わりゆく世界のリズム乗って モノクロ染めてゆく
riding the rhythm of a changing world, dyeing monochrome into color.

208
00:42:25,851 --> 00:42:34,351
閉じ込めなくてもいいの 不安感じても 私だけの色で描こう
It's okay not to lock it away; even if I feel anxious, I'll paint with my own color.

209
00:42:40,851 --> 00:42:47,351
きっと未来は色に溢れ まだ見ぬ世界はカラフルに染まる
Surely the future will overflow with color, painting the unseen world in vivid hues.

210
00:42:47,551 --> 00:42:55,351
もっと自由に羽ばたくから ずっと あの日感じたままに
Because I'll spread my wings more freely, staying true to what I felt that day.

211
00:42:55,651 --> 00:43:02,051
そっと伸ばしたこの手の先 描いた理想が想像を超える
Beyond this hand gently reached out, the ideal I drew exceeds imagination.

212
00:43:02,351 --> 00:43:11,351
やっと見つけた私の色 ずっと ずっと ずっと 描いてくの
Finally found my color, I'll keep drawing it forever, forever, forever.

213
00:43:31,351 --> 00:43:34,051
ありがとー！
Thank you!

214
00:43:36,051 --> 00:43:38,351
はい！というわけで...
Alright! So then...

215
00:43:38,851 --> 00:43:44,351
まずは自己紹介からしたいと思いますけど...
First off, I'd like to do my introduction, but...

216
00:43:47,051 --> 00:43:51,851
みんな、分かってる人と分かってない人いるかもしれないから、一応説明するんですが...
Some of you might know, and some might not, so I'll explain just in case...

217
00:43:51,851 --> 00:44:00,851
「うち、うち、うちだよー」って言ったら、みんな「大神ミオだよー」って言ってもらえたら、うちの自己紹介が完成するので...
When I say "It's me, me, me~!", if everyone responds with "It's Ookami Mio~!", my introduction will be complete...

218
00:44:00,851 --> 00:44:04,051
言ってもらってもいいですかー？
So could you all say it for me?

219
00:44:05,851 --> 00:44:08,351
それじゃあ、行きますよー！
Alright then, here we go!

220
00:44:08,851 --> 00:44:11,051
うち、うち、うちだよー！
It's me, me, me~!

221
00:44:11,351 --> 00:44:14,351
大神ミオだよー！
It's Ookami Mio~!

222
00:44:14,851 --> 00:44:22,851
わぁー！本日はおおかみみおのソロライブ開催おめでとうございます！
Waaah! Congratulations on holding Ookami Mio's solo live concert today!

223
00:44:27,851 --> 00:44:33,351
うちがおめでとうって言われる側だと思うんだけど、多分(笑)
Though I think I'm supposed to be the one receiving congratulations, probably (laughs).

224
00:44:35,351 --> 00:44:37,351
すごいみんなー！
Everyone is amazing!

225
00:44:37,851 --> 00:44:40,651
ソロライブの衣装、どうかなー？
How do you like my solo live outfit?

226
00:44:40,851 --> 00:44:43,051
可愛いー？嬉しい！
Cute? I'm so happy!

227
00:44:43,351 --> 00:44:53,351
なんと、なんと今回、あの...6年...と、まあ、もうちょっとで7年活動してきて... 尻尾が解放されてるんですー！
And guess what? This time, after... 6 years... well, almost 7 years of activity... my tails have been unlocked!

228
00:44:53,651 --> 00:44:56,351
見て、見てー！
Look, look!

229
00:44:57,351 --> 00:45:00,851
今までずっと...
Up until now, all this time...

230
00:45:02,092 --> 00:45:03,092
ここの
Here on my...

231
00:45:03,092 --> 00:45:04,192
足にね
leg, you see,

232
00:45:04,192 --> 00:45:05,492
巻き付いていた
it was wrapped around...

233
00:45:05,492 --> 00:45:06,692
尻尾がね
my tail, that is...

234
00:45:06,692 --> 00:45:09,792
見えちゃった感じなんですけれど
It looks like it became visible, but...

235
00:45:10,892 --> 00:45:12,892
嬉しいな なんか
I'm somehow happy about it!

236
00:45:13,092 --> 00:45:16,392
ま、これはうちの自信の表れと言いますか
Well, this is an expression of my confidence, you could say.

237
00:45:17,092 --> 00:45:22,092
自信がついたからこうやって尻尾が解放できたということで
Since I gained confidence, I was able to unleash my tail like this!

238
00:45:22,692 --> 00:45:24,592
この舞台に
To this stage...

239
00:45:24,592 --> 00:45:26,792
押し上げてくれたみんな、ありがとう！
Everyone who pushed me up to this stage, thank you!

240
00:45:32,592 --> 00:45:34,392
ちょっと...
Phew...

241
00:45:34,392 --> 00:45:36,592
汗かいてきちゃったかも...
I might have started sweating a bit...

242
00:45:38,592 --> 00:45:41,392
ありがとうございます！
Thank you very much!

243
00:45:42,092 --> 00:45:45,092
いやー ちょっとね 最初だし
Man... since it's still early on,

244
00:45:45,592 --> 00:45:49,892
コール＆レスポンスとかしてみたけれど
I wanted to try doing a call-and-response, but...

245
00:45:50,892 --> 00:45:52,592
どうかなー？
How about it?

246
00:45:55,592 --> 00:45:57,392
ちょっとやってみようかな？
Shall I give it a try?

247
00:45:57,392 --> 00:45:59,892
さっきね、オオカミミオにはなってもらったから
Earlier, I had you all act as "Ookami Mio",

248
00:46:00,292 --> 00:46:02,692
んー どうしようかなー
Hmm, what should we do?

249
00:46:03,892 --> 00:46:05,592
じゃあ、えっと
Then, well...

250
00:46:05,592 --> 00:46:07,192
「オオカミミオ ソロライブ」って言ったら
When I say "Ookami Mio Solo Live",

251
00:46:07,192 --> 00:46:09,192
みんな「アワースパークル！」って
everyone, could you say "OUR SPARKLE!"

252
00:46:09,192 --> 00:46:11,192
大きい声で言ってもらってもいいですか？
in a loud voice?

253
00:46:13,292 --> 00:46:14,892
ありがとう！
Thank you!

254
00:46:15,592 --> 00:46:17,092
じゃあ行きますよ！
Alright, here we go!

255
00:46:19,392 --> 00:46:22,092
オオカミミオ ソロライブ！
Ookami Mio Solo Live!

256
00:46:25,892 --> 00:46:27,592
ありがとうー！
Thank you!

257
00:46:28,592 --> 00:46:30,892
すっごくよく聴こえる！
I can hear you so clearly!

258
00:46:32,292 --> 00:46:35,392
ちょっとね、配信で見ている
For those watching on the stream,

259
00:46:35,892 --> 00:46:37,892
そこ君も！
you over there too!

260
00:46:37,892 --> 00:46:40,292
ツリー席の全員もよく見えてるよ！
I can see everyone in the tree seats clearly too!

261
00:46:40,292 --> 00:46:42,892
コメントもありがとね！
Thanks for the comments, too!

262
00:46:44,892 --> 00:46:46,892
いっぱい感心のね
Lots of my...

263
00:46:46,892 --> 00:46:49,892
可愛い姿をスクショしてもらえたら嬉しいなって
cute poses, I'd be happy if you screenshot them...

264
00:46:49,892 --> 00:46:50,892
思います！
...I think!

265
00:46:53,592 --> 00:46:56,892
現地のみんなは一旦記憶にキャプチャーしてね
Everyone here in person, capture it in your memory for now, okay?

266
00:46:58,592 --> 00:47:00,592
ありがとう！
Thank you!

267
00:47:01,592 --> 00:47:02,892
はい、そして
Yes, and...

268
00:47:02,892 --> 00:47:05,592
#ミオスパークル で
using the hashtag #MioSparkle,

269
00:47:05,592 --> 00:47:09,092
スクショや感想のポストもよろしくお願いします！
please post your screenshots and thoughts!

270
00:47:12,592 --> 00:47:14,092
ありがとう！
Thank you!

271
00:47:14,092 --> 00:47:15,592
いやさー
Man...

272
00:47:15,592 --> 00:47:17,592
もうオオカミミオソロライブ
Ookami Mio Solo Live...

273
00:47:17,592 --> 00:47:20,092
始まっちゃったらもうあっという間に
once it started, it felt like in an instant...

274
00:47:20,092 --> 00:47:22,292
終わっちゃうのかと思うと
thinking that it'll be over so soon...

275
00:47:22,292 --> 00:47:25,092
MCもまだまだ終わりたくないんだけど
I don't want the MC talk to end yet either, but...

276
00:47:25,092 --> 00:47:28,592
もう始まった瞬間から終わる心配してるんだけど
I've been worrying about it ending from the moment it started!

277
00:47:29,292 --> 00:47:30,892
今日はね
Today, you know,

278
00:47:30,892 --> 00:47:32,592
たくさん最高にキラキラな
let's make lots of the most sparkling...

279
00:47:32,592 --> 00:47:35,092
思い出作っていこうね！
...memories together!

280
00:47:40,292 --> 00:47:41,892
はい、そして
Yes, and...

281
00:47:41,892 --> 00:47:44,292
ちら見せ枠の皆さんには
to everyone watching the sneak peek...

282
00:47:44,292 --> 00:47:47,092
残念なお知らせなんですけれど...
I have a sad announcement...

283
00:47:49,092 --> 00:47:53,592
現地のみなさんはね、最後まで見れるのは確定なんですが
Everyone here in person is guaranteed to watch till the end, but...

284
00:47:54,292 --> 00:47:56,092
無料配信は
the free stream...

285
00:47:56,092 --> 00:47:59,292
ここでお別れとなります！
...will come to an end here!

286
00:48:02,292 --> 00:48:04,592
というわけでね
So then,

287
00:48:04,592 --> 00:48:07,092
ツリー席のチケットを買っていただければ
if you purchase a tree seat ticket,

288
00:48:07,092 --> 00:48:09,592
続きが見れますので
you can watch the rest of the show!

289
00:48:09,592 --> 00:48:11,592
ぜひぜひ買って頂ければなーって
So I'd be really glad if you bought one...

290
00:48:11,592 --> 00:48:13,892
ミオファのみんなも思ってるよね！
Miofa fans think so too, right!

291
00:48:13,892 --> 00:48:15,892
思ってまーす！
We think so!

292
00:48:15,892 --> 00:48:18,292
よろしくお願いします！
Thank you in advance!

293
00:48:20,092 --> 00:48:21,892
「行かないでー！」
"Don't go!"

294
00:48:21,892 --> 00:48:23,092
見て、おじーの...
Look, the old guys'...

295
00:48:23,092 --> 00:48:26,092
「行かないでー！頂戴よー！」
"Don't go! Give it to us!"

296
00:48:27,592 --> 00:48:30,092
イマジナリーミオファの声が聞こえてくるような...
It feels like I can hear imaginary Miofa voices...

297
00:48:32,592 --> 00:48:35,292
騒がしいミオファの声ですね
What a noisy bunch of Miofa voices!

298
00:48:35,892 --> 00:48:38,292
はい！というわけで
Alright! So then,

299
00:48:38,292 --> 00:48:40,892
そろそろ次の曲行きますか！
shall we move on to the next song soon!

300
00:48:44,092 --> 00:48:46,292
オオカミミオ ソロライブ
Ookami Mio Solo Live...

301
00:48:46,292 --> 00:48:48,592
盛り上がっていくぞー！
Let's get hyped up!

302
00:48:55,092 --> 00:49:02,092
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
[The sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching!]

303
00:50:01,100 --> 00:55:01,100
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching!

304
00:55:02,108 --> 00:55:09,108
無料パートは終了いたしました。ご視聴ありがとうございました！
The sneak peek part of the show has ended. Thank you for watching!

